# Repo-root build context (docker-compose context: .)
# Prevents host node_modules (Windows) from breaking Linux vite/npm binaries.

**/node_modules
**/.npm
**/.pnpm-store

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.vite
**/build
**/coverage

# Tests & reports (not needed in images)
test-results
playwright-report
tests/e2e/test-results
tests/e2e/playwright-report
tests/e2e/.auth-states
tests/e2e/.auth-cache.json
reports

# Git & IDE
.git
.gitignore
.github
.idea
.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Env secrets (injected via compose env_file / build-args)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
!.env.docker.lan.example
!.env.docker.template

# Docs & screenshots (large, not for runtime images)
Documents
Processes
docs
specs
*.md
!Isara-patient-portal/README.md
!Isara-doctor-portal/README.md
!Izara-jitsi-server/README.md

# Misc caches
**/.cache
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/temp
